# Target C — actual diameter endpoints cannot support translated double rails

```text
repeated macroscopic displacement of actual loaded endpoints
-> source ball-hull width capacity
-> a linear double rail requires macroscopic translation defects
-> a contact extension carries quadratic total path length
-> contradiction if that same extension is paid by a subquadratic source ledger;
   no such payment or physical endpoint/chart identification is assumed.
```

